[Quotes] ;English
victory1 = "I did not fight most of the time before but, but this was kind of fun."
victory2 = "Sometimes I do drink blood, but it's not the blood that I like."
victory3 = "Life's not all fun and games, you know. Ah, just boning with ya. Of course it is! If you're awesome."
victory4 = "I enjoyed making you suffer here... and did you?"
victory5 = "How am I still alive during daylight you ask? Well, I'm wearing sunscreen! Hah!"
victory6 = "Ugh, you broke my axe with your face! How am I supposed to get a new one around these parts?"
victory7 = "PB better make this worth my while when all is said and done. If all fights went like that, I might die of boredom!"
victory8 = "Lame. You call that a fight?"
victory9 = "I'm not mean. I'm a thousand years old, and I just lost track of my moral code."
victory10 = "It's Morbin' Time."
victory11 = "Hey, you guys need to stop trying to kill my friends."

;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Character-specific
victory12 = "You may have tried to burn me Ms. Sun, but you're more like playing with fire! Heeheehee..."    ;Sunset Shimmer
victory13 = "I'm gonna take your apples and taste their red..."    ;Applejack
victory14 = "Hey little kid, you're supposed to be afraid of me, but I guess you're only afraid of witches, dork."    ;El Chavo
victory15 = "And you're still mediocre with your lackluster spells little dorkly witch! Hahaha!"    ;Akko Kagari
victory16 = "This must be my dad's doing... he cloned me..."    ;Herself
victory17 = "Woah there, you say you have a dragon inside? I don't see you do..."    ;Kan'u Unchou
victory18 = "If you're a demon, then you may go to the Nightosphere instead of going into a vampire hunt you psycho."    ;Shim
victory19 = "Don't be a butt. It takes more than your silly toys to stop the Vampire Queen."    ;Dexter
victory20 = "Maybe you should've fought with a wooden stake than that cheap dime store sword, hero!"    ;Samurai Jack
victory21 = "Quit kidding yourself. I raise the dead to mess with people, so your little reaper act doesn't faze me!"    ;Grim
victory22 = "You're a bit like Peebubs with all of that pink. If I used my vampire powers on you, would I be blowing bubbles after?"    ;Blossom
victory23 = "I like your shirt, kid. Hope you're not too attached to it!"    ;Numbuh One
victory24 = "I can suck more types of blood than you, specially during night time."    ;Demitri Maximoff
victory25 = "It may be that you, being so young, are an expert in this magic stuff, but I still surpass you."    ;Diana Cavendish
victory26 = "It seems that your old-fashioned vampire powers are as weak and boring as that ''super fun happy slide'' of yours."    ;Burn Vampiro
victory27 = "Not bad... for a henchman."    ;Finn
victory28 = "I'm just your problem."    ;Bonnibel

